[231.914556, "o", "come exceeds the applicable amount, the amount of the itemized deductions otherwise allowable for the taxable year shall be reduced by the lesser of-\r\n477:    (1) 3 percent of the excess of adjusted gross income over the applicable amount, or\r\n"]
